From 27aad5124596a863e9c5c1bf405a121735755ba7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominique Belhachemi <db@domibel.de>
Date: Sun, 26 Apr 2026 00:03:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 04/53] drm/imagination: enable BXE-4-32 on StarFive JH7110

Add the BXE-4-32 feature layout and firmware data paths needed by
BVNC 36.50.54.182. This covers queue, VM, free-list, power, and firmware
state used by the JH7110 implementation.

The original downstream work reached firmware startup and vulkaninfo on
a VisionFive 2 with Mesa's explicit non-conformant opt-in. Later patches
keep the exact core behind the kernel experimental-hardware gate.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5
